      Wait until you're weak from hunger--you shouldn't need to wait until
you're fainting--and then #pray.  Unless you've overprayed or just been
granted some divine benefit, your patron deity will fill your belly.

      Wearing amulets and rings increases food consumption (some more than
others), as does carrying too much junk around for extended periods.  Just
because your wizard starts out with a pair of rings doesn't mean you should
simply wear them all the time.  If you do, you will probably weaken from
hunger before the time-out period of your previous prayer has expired, so
a new prayer will result in an angry response...



